@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Client Arduino" as Client
participant "Host Arduino" as Host

note over Client, Host: <b>Setup Phase</b>\nBoth share MAGIC_BYTE (0x4D)\nHost has generated SessionID (e.g., 5)

== Scenario 1: Successful Move (Happy Path) ==

note left of Client: User presses 'Reveal'\nCurrent TxSeq = 0

Client -> Host: <b>MSG_REVEAL</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:0 | Data: (2,2)]\n+ CRC Checksum
activate Client
    note right of Client: Starts 300ms Timer

    Host -> Host: 1. Decode & Validate CRC
    Host -> Host: 2. Check SessionID (5==5)

    Host -> Client: <b>MSG_ACK</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:0]
    activate Host
    deactivate Host

    Host -> Host: 3. Seq != LastRxSeq?\nProcess Move (2,2)
    note right of Host: LastRxSeq = 0

Client -> Client: Received ACK (Seq 0)\nStop Timer
note left of Client: Toggle TxSeq -> 1
deactivate Client

== Scenario 2: Packet Lost (Interference) ==

note left of Client: User presses 'Flag'\nCurrent TxSeq = 1

Client ->x Host: <b>MSG_FLAG</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:1 | Data: (1,1)]
note right of Client: Interference! Host receives nothing.

Client -> Client: Timer Expires (300ms)

note left of Client: <b>Retry Attempt 1</b>
Client -> Host: <b>MSG_FLAG</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:1 | Data: (1,1)]
activate Client

    Host -> Host: Validate & Check Session
    Host -> Client: <b>MSG_ACK</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:1]

    Host -> Host: Process Flag (1,1)
    note right of Host: LastRxSeq = 1

Client -> Client: Received ACK (Seq 1)
note left of Client: Toggle TxSeq -> 0
deactivate Client

== Scenario 3: ACK Lost (Duplicate Handling) ==

note left of Client: User presses 'Reveal'\nCurrent TxSeq = 0

Client -> Host: <b>MSG_REVEAL</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:0 | Data: (3,3)]
activate Client

    Host -> Host: Process Move (3,3)
    note right of Host: LastRxSeq = 0

    Host ->x Client: <b>MSG_ACK</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:0]
    note left of Host: ACK lost in transmission

Client -> Client: Timer Expires (300ms)
note left of Client: Client thinks Host missed it.\n<b>Retry Attempt 1</b>

Client -> Host: <b>MSG_REVEAL</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:0 | Data: (3,3)]

    Host -> Host: Validate Packet
    Host -> Host: <b>Duplicate Check:</b>\nSeq (0) == LastRxSeq (0)
    note right of Host: <b>IGNORE PAYLOAD</b>\nDo not reveal tile twice.

    Host -> Client: <b>MSG_ACK</b> [Sess:5 | Seq:0]
    note right of Host: Resend ACK only

Client -> Client: Received ACK (Seq 0)
note left of Client: Toggle TxSeq -> 1
deactivate Client
@enduml